<title>USA: InterAmericas Communications names CFO.</title>
<headline>InterAmericas Communications names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>InterAmericas Communications Corp said Thursday it appointed Douglas Geib II as chief financial officer effective May 1.</p>
<p>Prior to joining InterAmericas, Geib was a partner with Ernst &amp; Young LLP. He has over 20 years experience in finance, accounting, restructuring, acquisitions, and auditing in fields including telecommunications, manufacturing, real estate, healthcare, and retail, InterAmericas said.</p>
<p>A statement issued by the company did not say who Geib was replacing and no one from the company was immediately available for comment.  </p>
<p>A company spokeswoman later said Geib is the first CFO the company has had.</p>
